Subject: Second order test in mixedmirt function
Message-ID: <9J-QYvqusU4.jA9OYdwTBgAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/mirt-package/c/9J-QYvqusU4/m/jA9OYdwTBgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
